; Regression (2026-09-23): a const ARRAY global element that is not one integer
; constant. The Emitter took every constant CELL of an element as an element of
; its own and skipped the operators, so `[0x10, 0 - 0x5, 0x30]` emitted
; `[16, 0, 5]` at rc 0. Every element is folded exactly since 2026-10-19
; (Planner.fold_initializer#, global_init_exact.scaly); one that does not fit
; the element type is this diagnostic.
; xfail: the constant 300 does not fit u8, the type it is declared
define MIXED: u8[] [1, 200 + 100, 5]

function pick(i: int) returns int
    MIXED[i] as int

if pick(2) = 5
    print("PASS")
